OL,3,AMarried at First Sight UK cancelled
OL,4,Aafter BBC revealed rape allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review was commissioned by Channel 4
OL,7,Fshortly after the BBC first contacted
OL,8,Fthe broadcaster, with details of the
OL,9,Fallegations we had heard.
OL,11,FOn Thursday, Channel 4 repeated its
OL,12,Fapology to the women and rejected the
OL,13,Foption to revive the show with stronger
OL,14,Fsafeguards, saying the programme has
OL,15,F"run its course".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/41
