OL,3,A'Nothing diminishes gravity' of Henry
OL,4,ANowak's death, appeal court reviewing
OL,5,Akiller's sentence hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FDigwa was given permission to challenge
OL,8,Fthe length of his sentence at the Court
OL,9,Fof Appeal
OL,11,FJonathan Polnay KC, for the Attorney
OL,12,FGeneral, argued Digwa's 21-year minimum
OL,13,Fterm was too lenient, citing his use of
OL,14,Fa kirpan, abusing the religious
OL,15,Fexemption to carry it, and his conduct
OL,16,Fas Henry Nowak lay dying
OL,18,FImran Khan KC, for Digwa, argued his
OL,19,F21-year minimum term was too long,
OL,20,Fsaying the judge counted overlapping
OL,21,Faggravating factors more than once
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/41
