OL,3,ATop Democrat says Congress will rein in
OL,4,A'out-of-control' Trump administration
OL,5,Aafter midterms win
OL,6,
OL,7,FA top Democrat says Congress will rein
OL,8,Fin "an out-of-control executive branch"
OL,9,Fafter his party won control of both
OL,10,Fhouses in the midterm elections
OL,12,FHakeem Jeffries - likely to be the next
OL,13,FSpeaker of the House - accuses the
OL,14,F"Trump Cartel" of "massive corruption"
OL,15,Fand adds: "We are going to hold the
OL,16,Fcrooks accountable"
OL,18,FAfter the Democrats' resounding win in
OL,19,FTuesday's elections, President Trump
OL,20,Fsaid it was "largely true" the Iran war
OL,21,Fwas to blame for the Republican Party's
OL,22,Fdefeat
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/41
