OL,3,AWhat Democrats can and can't do with
OL,4,Atheir new power after taking Congress
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter months of promises on the
OL,7,Fcampaign trail ` to investigate
OL,8,Fcorruption; lower the costs of
OL,9,Fhealthcare, groceries and petrol; and
OL,10,Fcurtail the Iran war ` they will now
OL,11,Fbegin the much tougher process of
OL,12,Fputting plans into action.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG16/41
